        <h3>The Income Threshold Explained</h3>
        <p>The DNV income requirement is set at <strong>200% of Spain's Minimum Interpersonal Salary (SMI)</strong>. For 2026, the SMI is approximately €1,184 per month, making the requirement around €2,763/month or €33,150 annually.</p>
